From: bringup <bringup@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:36:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/38] kebab: XNU-002a pack prebuilt UniXNU.efi +
 UniXNUDxe.efi into the FV

Built offline from UniXNU/UniXNU @ b6ae99c1 (package/build.sh, CLANGPDB,
DEBUG) against this tree's Mu_Basecore; no device-specific sheng inputs.

Packed as binary FFS files (no DSC entry needed):
  FILE APPLICATION = 9B665204-A133-47A2-9396-9E2B370A4E25  (UniXNU.efi)
  FILE DRIVER      = 29B950CF-586D-49EA-9D71-F88645CCDAF6  (UniXNUDxe.efi)

UniXNUDxe looks the application up by that GUID (PcdUniXNUApplicationFile)
via Fv->ReadFile, then registers a Boot#### option and puts it FIRST in
BootOrder. Consequence: UniXNU will be the default boot entry; the Project
Silicium menu remains reachable but is no longer first.
